    "Details": "Prototype Hellcat-Ps are identical to the current production iteration in nearly every aspect except for the engine. The heavier power plant's reduced top speed made it undesirable for many of Clan Jade Falcon's front-line light and medium Stars. It was soon relegated to solahma units. While there is demand to return to these under-engined specs by customers hoping for a bargain, discerning customers are instead referred to the standard model (for maximum profit via the XXL engine).\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
